Package: SpatialESS
Type: Package
Title: Efficient Edge-First Spatial Cell-Cell Communication
Version: 0.1.3
Authors@R: person("DENG", "Zifeng", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "zifengd8@gmail.com")
Description: Provides an independent high-performance implementation of the
    SpatialCellChat V3 spatial communication workflow. Compact CSR radius
    graphs, exact sparse type-7 triMean summaries, streamed CellChat-compatible
    molecular scoring and sparse permutation inference reduce runtime and
    memory while preserving explicit numerical validation boundaries. The
    package also provides sample-level multi-patient communication modelling with patient-random-intercept linear mixed models.
